demonstrate pdf generation with a command line, django command an view

1) checkout the source
	hg clone https://hg.reportlab.com/hg-public/noddy-pdf

2) create a modern python venv using eg
	python310 -mvenv noddy-pdf

3) in noddy-pdf activate the python
	source bin/activate

4) migrate with
	./manage.py migrate

5) generate using cli
	python -mproject.noddy.doc

6) generate using django command
	./manage.py generate_pdf

7) generate using a the view
	./manage.py runserver

	visit http://localhost:8000/pdf
